*> vybe-test: cobol/level_numbers/test_level_88_value_thru
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_level_numbers.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-AGE PIC 9(3) VALUE 25.
   88 IS-YOUTH VALUE 15 THRU 30.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    IF IS-YOUTH
        DISPLAY "YOUTH"
    ELSE
        DISPLAY "OTHER"
    END-IF.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING "YOUTH" DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "YOUTH"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [YOUTH] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

